OL,3,AMigrants taken to Dover after more than
OL,4,A30 hours at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 51 migrants arrived in Dover
OL,7,Fon a small boat after spending more
OL,8,Fthan 30 hours at sea.
OL,10,FThe arrival at 00:30 BST came after
OL,11,Fprotesters gathered in the Hampshire
OL,12,Ftown of Gosport on Tuesday evening as
OL,13,Fit was initially believed this is where
OL,14,Fthey would be brought ashore.
OL,16,FThe boat left the Normandy coast on
OL,17,FMonday morning and the French
OL,18,Fcoastguard, which shadowed it, said the
OL,19,Fmigrants were in "precarious
OL,20,Fconditions" and refused help as they
OL,21,Fwere "determined to take all risks to
OL,22,Freach" the UK.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
